## Business Objective

The ultimate goal is to convert transaction-level data into actionable insights that can support decisions around customer engagement, portfolio growth, retention, merchant performance, and promotional offers.

> This is an independent portfolio project inspired by payment-network analytics use cases and is not an actual NPCI project.
